WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:08,370
Is it ok?

2
00:00:09,170 --> 00:00:19,780
Brother Lin later admitted that I feel good, Lin Feng

3
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:22,380
I brought Xiao Tang to Lin Shiyin

4
00:00:22,580 --> 00:00:27,410
Sister Shiyin, why are you here, Xiao Tang?

5
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:30,650
It's better to come early than to come late

6
00:00:31,050 --> 00:00:34,170
Everyone, sit down. Don't stand. We might see each other more often in the future.

7
00:00:34,750 --> 00:00:35,670
You come to beg too

8
00:00:35,870 --> 00:00:37,230
You can come, I can't come

9
00:00:37,970 --> 00:00:39,570
Brother Lin Feng, do you still have something to eat?

10
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:45,730
My stomach has been growling all night. Let's eat. Let's talk about it first. If something happens here, no one is allowed to mention it in this camp.

11
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:52,210
The three idiots spoke at the same time. Next

12
00:00:52,650 --> 00:01:17,470
It depends on how Su Weiwei took over Shiyin, where are you, Miss Chen?

13
00:01:17,710 --> 00:01:19,090
I haven't slept yet
